<h2 style="color: #0F3725; margin-top: 0; font-weight: 800;">Withdrawal Payout Receipt</h2>
<p>Dear <strong><%= userName %></strong>,</p>
<p>Your withdrawal payout request has been successfully submitted and processed. Below is your official transaction receipt for your records.</p>

<div class="highlight-box" style="margin-top: 20px;">
  <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #0F3725; border-bottom: 1px solid #E5E7EB; padding-bottom: 8px;">Transaction Summary</h3>
  
  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 14px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #F3F4F6; color: #6B7280;">Transaction Reference:</td>
      <td style="padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #F3F4F6; text-align: right; font-weight: 600; color: #111827; font-family: monospace;">
        #<%= reference %>
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #F3F4F6; color: #6B7280;">Date & Time:</td>
      <td style="padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #F3F4F6; text-align: right; font-weight: 600; color: #111827;">
        <%= date %>
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #F3F4F6; color: #6B7280;">Destination Bank:</td>
      <td style="padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #F3F4F6; text-align: right; font-weight: 600; color: #111827;">
        <%= bankName %>
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #F3F4F6; color: #6B7280;">Account Number:</td>
      <td style="padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #F3F4F6; text-align: right; font-weight: 600; color: #111827;">
        •••• <%= accountNumber.slice(-4) %>
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #F3F4F6; color: #6B7280;">Account Name:</td>
      <td style="padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #F3F4F6; text-align: right; font-weight: 600; color: #111827;">
        <%= accountName %>
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #F3F4F6; color: #6B7280;">Status:</td>
      <td style="padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #F3F4F6; text-align: right; font-weight: 700; color: #059669;">
        <%= status %>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 15px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 8px 0; color: #4B5563;"><strong>Amount Withdrawn:</strong></td>
      <td style="padding: 8px 0; text-align: right; font-weight: bold; color: #0F3725; font-size: 20px;">
        <%= currencySymbol %><%= amount.toLocaleString() %>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

<p style="color: #4B5563; margin-top: 24px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;">
  Funds are typically credited to your verified bank account within a few minutes, subject to inter-bank clearing networks.
  If you have questions regarding this transfer, please contact GoEatOne Support with your reference number.
</p>
